<!--
    Backup rules for Android 11 and older, where Android reads this file instead of
    data_extraction_rules.xml. Scalable needs Android 14 or newer, so in practice that file is the
    one that applies, but the manifest still points here and the two are kept consistent. Leaving
    the list empty backs up all of the app's data, which is the database of accounts, weigh-ins,
    and goals (passwords only as salted hashes), so a user's history is restored if they move to
    a new phone.
-->
<full-backup-content />
